Subject: [PATCH] UIQ-1: an explain link opened directly is a page, not raw
 markup

The fragment began with a newline, went out as text/plain, and a new tab
printed the tags. Navigations now get the app page with one h1; the dialog
asks for the fragment with X-Fragment. Empty when/who lines lose their stray dot.

